; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>An eerie <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ごうおん">roar</STYLE> rang out without warning―
{PAUSE ""}
This is the same sound I heard at Toyotake Station!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸速い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> and I ran outside and looked up at the sky.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A beautiful moon hung in the sky, ill-matched to the echoing <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ごうおん">roar</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And under that sky―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> seemed to have come out of the storehouse too, startled by the sound.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I hope she's okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">She hasn't answered my messages either... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I guess the signal really doesn't reach underground."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―And then <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> suddenly grabbed <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> by the shoulders and roared at her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\五島夏菜責める.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! You told her!? You talked about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> took <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> by both shoulders, shook her, and pressed her in a loud voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... what about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Did you tell her that </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was going to the cave!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... what's wrong!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please stay inside the house!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　And close your eyes, and cover your ears too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The roar that had been aimed at <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> was turned on me too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that glare, thrust up at me from below, I took a step back.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh, um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Never mind that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please just come, quickly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸速い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> grabbed my hand by force and pulled me into the house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま早く開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "500" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, listen!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Do NOT leave this room, <TXSPD TIME="500">abso-lute-ly<TXSPN> not!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... what's this about...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I can't explain that!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　When you need the bathroom, call me!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Do not leave this room without me, ever!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... o-okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, but right now this is the only way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま早く開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The fusuma was shut with a snap.<PG>
What is this... why won't anyone tell me anything...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she that resentful about being shut up in this settlement because of me? Does she hate me?<PG>
No, no, that's not it. <STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE> attitude wasn't anything so simple.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> was panicking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Panicking because I'd learned what <STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE> was doing.<PG>
In other words, it's bad for me to know the current situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could the reason be?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The first thing that comes to mind is my precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> apparently has the same ability I do―does it have something to do with her being missing?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A message seems to have arrived.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, for now, just do as everyone says."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was from <STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Through the bugging app, <STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE> knows everyone's situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet he sent a message rather than calling, and such a vague one at that, which means...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Okay, thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do is trust everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do is stop my ears and turn my eyes from everything and devote myself to 'knowing nothing.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So what I can do is 'do nothing.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Believe what <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> says, and just stay here―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\新村本家2階天井.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Lying on my back, I stared blankly at a corner of the ceiling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The settlement where such a <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ごうおん">roar</STYLE> had rung out just now was strangely quiet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A place so quiet you'd wonder whether people really lived here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I even found myself thinking that maybe I was the only one left in this settlement right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> had all actually gone from here...<PG>
I gave myself up to that impossible fantasy and cursed this constitution of mine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ended up with this constitution because of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I let the balloon fly, got <STYLE ID="11">Haruka's dad</STYLE> killed, and got his blood on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the beginning of everything.<PG>
If I hadn't let the balloon fly that day, <STYLE ID="11">Haruka's dad</STYLE> wouldn't have died, and nobody would have been dragged into all this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Regret at this point is useless, but I never imagined it would turn into something this big.<PG>
Something as small as letting a balloon fly has grown into a huge case, one thing toppling the next in a chain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if it were all a single story, plotted out in advance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like a current you can't resist―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
A story plotted out in advance...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
No, surely not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What if this 'someone' <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> called <STYLE ID="12">Necro</STYLE> had plotted out <STYLE ID="13">everything</STYLE>, every single bit...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm. Somewhere along the line, <STYLE ID="12">Necro</STYLE>'s will intervened―no doubt about that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some events happened by chance, but <STYLE ID="12">Necro</STYLE> didn't let them slip; it intervened, disguised as more chance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Going by everything I've heard, that's perfectly possible.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Then where does <STYLE ID="12">Necro</STYLE>'s story begin and end?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is <STYLE ID="12">Necro</STYLE>, to begin with?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Granting precognition, making cherry trees sprout out of nowhere―clearly something not human.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, let's stop thinking. I mustn't know.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Let me send <STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE> a message at least.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's taking a while coming back, too.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, are you okay? You haven't come back for ages, so I'm worried."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I watched the sent message for a while, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
no sign of it being marked read.
